@fact ilse.furs
# en: Kael's younger sister: white furs, a private snowstorm and coins that freeze to counters.
text [e7eab1] = 凯尔的妹妹：一身白裘，一场随身的私人小暴风雪，还有会冻在柜台上的硬币。

@fact ilse.raised
# en: The Hollow cult raised her to open a door she has never seen.
text [a006d7] = 空洞教团把她养大，要她去打开一扇她从没见过的门。

@fact ilse.frost_craft
# en: She knows Northern frost-craft better than anything the professors teach.
text [ac2fad] = 她对北境霜术的了解，胜过教授们教的任何东西。

@fact ilse.grey
# en: The man in grey came to take her home. She didn't call for help; she only looked.
text [f8b96d] = 灰衣人来带她回家。她没有呼救，只是看着。

@fact ilse.scared
# en: She admits, to her brother, that she was scared. So was he.
text [fe62fb] = 她向哥哥承认，她当时很害怕。他也是。

@fact ilse.stitch
# en: The stitch in her frost-wards is her mother's. Ilse learned it from her; Kael knows it at a touch.
text [c30e43] = 她霜护符上的针法是她母亲的。伊尔泽跟母亲学的；凯尔一摸就认得出来。
